<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3733/38  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.6731/36  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.8824/34  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.4385/95  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     34.51/51   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.6415/45  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1683.1/3.6 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     122.38/43  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     7.6747/22  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.8028/48  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.3920/40  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4385/90  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7880/85  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7470/75  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.5898/08</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$349.10/349.60</p>
